---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout page="about">
  <main class="div">
    <div class="div-8">
      <div class="div-9">
        &quot;Lizaveta is tactful in communicating with clients and colleagues,
        non-conflict, sociable, knows how to work in a team.&quot;
      </div>
      <div class="div-10">
        <div class="div-11">
          <div class="column">
            <div class="div-12">
              &quot;She displayed strong professionalism, patience with others and
              desire to share her knowledge with the team.&quot;
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-2">
            <img src="profile.jpeg" alt="Lizaveta Kukharava" class="img">
          </div>
          <div class="column-3">
            <div class="div-13">
              “Liza was a pleasure to work with, she's easygoing, smart and a very
              responsible worker. She's always focused and determined and isn't
              afraid to dive into details.”
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="div-14">
        <h1 class="div-15">what i bring to the table</h1>
        <img src="assets/section-arrow.svg" alt="" class="img-2">
      </div>
      <div class="div-16">
        <div class="div-17">
          <div class="column-4">
            <div class="div-18">
              Known for my easy-going nature, non-conflict attitude, and can-do
              spirit, I bring a high level of responsibility and an eagerness to
              explore new horizons and share insights.
              <br>
              <br>
              My interest in UX design was sparked by the realization that my
              interaction with customers as a Customer Acquisition Specialist
              could extend beyond understanding their pain points to actively
              providing solutions.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-5">
            <div class="div-19">
              <div class="div-20">
                <div class="column-6">
                  <div class="div-21">
                    <div class="div-22">Communication</div>
                    <div class="div-23">Active Listening</div>
                    <div class="div-24">Attention to Detail</div>
                    <div class="div-25">Problem Solving</div>
                    <div class="div-26">Presentation Skills</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="column-7">
                  <div class="div-27">
                    <div class="div-28">UX Research</div>
                    <div class="div-29">Wireframing &amp; Prototyping</div>
                    <div class="div-30">Content Design</div>
                    <div class="div-31">Coding basics</div>
                    <div class="div-32">Analytical thinking</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="div-33">
        <div class="div-34">
          <div class="column-8">
            <div class="div-35">
              <img loading="lazy" src="andersenoffice.jpg" alt="Andersen lab office" class="img-3">
              <div class="div-36">
                Andersen lab office. Credits: Anastasia Andreyko on LinkedIn
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-9">
            <div class="div-37">
              <h2 class="div-38">Growth and improvement</h2>
              <div class="div-39">
                Seeking independence and market experience, I joined an IT company
                as a Customer Acquisition Specialist. I grew together with the
                company, exploring various aspects of the IT process and improving
                departmental performance by continuously improving myself. My
                experience and empathy naturally led me to a Team Lead position.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="div-40">
        <div class="div-41">
          <div class="column-10">
            <div class="div-42">
              <img loading="lazy" src="classroom.jpg" alt="Coding classes at ReDI School Kids program" class="img-4">
              <div class="div-43">
                Volunteering for the coding classes at ReDI School Kids program
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-11">
            <div class="div-44">
              <h2 class="div-45">Empathy and communication</h2>
              <div class="div-46">
                Initially I pursued a degree in language teaching and
                interpreting. During working with kids, I learned how to
                communicate clearly, provide feedback, and support children
                seeking understanding. This experience honed my skills in empathy
                and communication, which are crucial in UX design.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="div-47">
        <div class="div-48">
          <div class="column-12">
            <div class="div-49">
              <img loading="lazy" src="Laptop.jpg" alt="Designing an app at home" class="img-5">
              <div class="div-50">
                Designing my very first app at home
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-13">
            <div class="div-51">
              <h2 class="div-52">Going extra mile</h2>
              <div class="div-53">
                Realising I could do more for customers and help solve their
                problems, I dived into the UX field. I immersed myself in the
                design process, understanding the importance of research and
                communication, and created my first app prototypes. This journey
                has been about constant learning and growth, driving me to create
                better user experiences every day.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="div-54">
        Reach out to contact@lizaveta.co to team up and transform your challenges into wins.
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
